Motor Driver PCB (textual): motor_driver.kicad_pcb

Board outline: 40mm x 30mm
Placement guidance:
- J1 motor power input on left edge
- TB6612FNG near center with motor outputs to right edge connectors
- CTRL connector at bottom edge connecting to main board

Thermal notes:
- Add thermal vias under motor power area if heat is expected
- Use 2 oz copper if currents approach upper TB6612 limits
